<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (At Bank of America, we believe Diversity & Inclusion \(D&I\) drives innovation, employee engagement, and customer satisfaction. By fostering an inclusive culture and using AI to attract diverse talent, we can improve productivity and better meet customer needs. This report outlines our strategy to integrate AI into recruitment and internship programs, helping us find and develop future leaders. Prioritizing D&I will strengthen our workforce and enhance customer experiences, driving growth for the company.)
/E (At Bank of America, we believe Diversity & Inclusion \(D&I\) drives innovation, employee engagement, and customer satisfaction. By fostering an inclusive culture and using AI to attract diverse talent, we can improve productivity and better meet customer needs. This report outlines our strategy to integrate AI into recruitment and internship programs, helping us find and develop future leaders. Prioritizing D&I will strengthen our workforce and enhance customer experiences, driving growth for the company.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [11]
>>
