/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (we're leveraging AI to enhance customer service and improve experiences. Our virtual financial assistant, Erica, helps clients with tasks like budgeting and payments, offering fast and intuitive support. Additionally, our CashPro Chat platform assists corporate clients with their treasury operations, providing quick access to transaction information and account details. These AI-driven tools demonstrate our commitment to using technology to better serve our clients.)
/E (we're leveraging AI to enhance customer service and improve experiences. Our virtual financial assistant, Erica, helps clients with tasks like budgeting and payments, offering fast and intuitive support. Additionally, our CashPro Chat platform assists corporate clients with their treasury operations, providing quick access to transaction information and account details. These AI-driven tools demonstrate our commitment to using technology to better serve our clients.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
732 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (At Bank of America, we recognize that the banking sector is highly competitive, with major players like JPMorgan and Capital One leading in AI development and innovation. While these institutions are making significant strides, we differentiate ourselves by integrating advanced technology with a strong human touch, ensuring that our clients receive both innovative solutions and personalized service.)
/E (At Bank of America, we recognize that the banking sector is highly competitive, with major players like JPMorgan and Capital One leading in AI development and innovation. While these institutions are making significant strides, we differentiate ourselves by integrating advanced technology with a strong human touch, ensuring that our clients receive both innovative solutions and personalized service.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [16]
>>
