/E (Diverse teams bring a wider range of perspectives and experiences to the table, leading to more innovative solutions and better decision-making. They also tend to be more engaged and productive, providing a more positive and inclusive work environment. By increasing diversity at all levels, financial institutions can unlock significant competitive advantages and drive sustainable revenue growth.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
